# KEYS: imv
>cli image viewer.

## Navigation & File Control

| Key | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| **q** | Quit imv |
| **Left / n / p** | Previous image |
| **Right / Space** | Next image |
| **gg** | Go to first image |
| **G** | Go to last image |
| **x** | Close current image |
| **f** | Toggle fullscreen |
| **d** | Toggle overlay (info/metadata) |
| **p** | Print current image path to stdout |

---

## Panning & Zooming

### Panning (Movement)
* **h** - Pan left
* **j** - Pan down
* **k** - Pan up
* **l** - Pan right

### Zooming
* **Up / i / +** - Zoom in
* **Down / o / -** - Zoom out
* **a** - Zoom to actual size (1:1)
* **r** - Reset zoom and pan to default

---

## Image Manipulation & View Modes

### Orientation
* **Ctrl+r** - Rotate clockwise by 90°

### Scaling & Placement
* **c** - Center image in window
* **s** - Cycle through scaling modes (Fixed, Fit, Fill)
* **S** - Cycle through upscaling modes

---

## Animations & Slideshows

### Animations (GIF/WebP)
* **.** - Next frame
* **Space** - Toggle Play/Pause

### Slideshow Mode
* **t** - Start slideshow / Increase delay by 1 second
* **T** - Stop slideshow / Decrease delay by 1 second

